# Read the manifesto first

Before changing this project, read `MANIFESTO.md` and `AGENTS.md`.

The manifesto is a product requirement. Preserve productive struggle, the
slow hint ladder, evidence-qualified learner memory, strict local-first
privacy, minimal Chrome permissions, runtime validation, and the restrained
typographic interface.

Do not implement complete-solution delivery, answer-shaped pseudocode,
automatic editor access, fixed learner labels, analytics, a hidden backend,
or decorative dashboard UI.
